      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día, Dioniso estaba de pie sobre una roca alta, junto al mar.",
          "en": "One day, Dionysus stood on a high rock by the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tenía el pelo largo y oscuro, y un manto morado. Parecía un joven apuesto.",
          "en": "He had long dark hair and a purple cloak. He looked like a handsome young man."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pasó un barco. Era de piratas, ladrones del mar de una tierra llamada Tirrenia.",
          "en": "A ship sailed by. It belonged to pirates, sea robbers from a land called Tyrrhenia."
        },
        {
          "es": "Vieron su manto morado y lujoso, y pensaron: «¡Debe de ser un príncipe!»",
          "en": "They saw his rich purple cloak and thought: \"He must be a prince!\""
        },
        {
          "es": "«Su familia pagará mucho oro para recuperarlo»",
          "en": "\"His family will pay a lot of gold to get him back.\""
        }
      ],
