      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Ahora los piratas tenían miedo. «¡Lleva el barco a tierra!», le gritaron al timonel.",
          "en": "Now the pirates were afraid. \"Steer to land!\" they shouted at the helmsman."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero era demasiado tarde.",
          "en": "But it was too late."
        },
        {
          "es": "Dioniso cambió. Se convirtió en un león enorme, y rugió desde la cubierta.",
          "en": "Dionysus changed. He became a huge lion, and he roared from the deck."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y en medio del barco apareció un oso peludo, parado sobre sus patas traseras.",
          "en": "And in the middle of the ship, a shaggy bear appeared, standing on its back legs."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los piratas corrieron a la popa y se amontonaron alrededor del timonel.",
          "en": "The pirates ran to the back of the ship, and crowded around the helmsman."
        }
      ],
